als from the soil, but those materials are intakes, not the food the plant makes.\"\\n      }\\n    ],\\n    \"correct_option_id\": \"soil_is_food\"\\n  },\\n  \"feedback\": {\\n    \"correct\": \"Exactly. The plant is a producer: it makes its own food inside itself, and the soil only supplies one of the materials it takes in.\",\\n    \"incorrect\": \"Look again at the producer idea. The plant makes its own food; the soil is only one of the materials it takes in, not the food itself.\"\\n  }\\n}'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': '1 validation error:\\n```json\\n[\\n  {\\n    \"type\": \"missing\",\\n    \"loc\": [\\n      \"response\"\\n    ],\\n    \"msg\": \"Field required\"\\n  }\\n]\\n```\\n\\nFix the errors and try again.'}], 'model': 'deepseek-flash', 'max_completion_tokens': 8000, 'stream': False}, 'extra_json': {'thinking': {'type': 'disabled'}}}"}
